# Chat build label footer

Before sending a **final** response to the user in this repo, read `Code/GameBuildLabel.cs` (constant `GameBuildLabel.Display`) and append one last line to the message.

Format (replace `X.Y.Z` with the actual constant value, no braces):

`Build label — vX.Y.Z (Assistant)`

If the file is missing or unreadable:

`Build label — (see GameBuildLabel.cs) (Assistant)`

Keep the rest of the reply unchanged.
